          <para>Creates a new MatchInfo.Builder reporting a match with the given property path. A property path is a dot-delimited sequence of property names indicating which property in the document these snippets correspond to. Example properties: 'body', 'sender.name', 'sender.emailaddress', etc. For class example 1, this returns "subject".</para>
